> restore, preserve
>         import delimited https://www.opencodelists.org/codelist/opensafely/long-acting-injectable-and-depot-statins-dmd/536cc8dc/download.csv, stringcols(1 3) favorstrfixed c
> lear
>         
>         rename dmd_id dmdid
>         
>         //Check code and dmdid are the same
>         count if code != dmdid
>         drop code
